<title>UK: SGA sets warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued up to 10 million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Reinsurance shares, lead manager Societe Generale Bank &amp; Trust, Zurich said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 200 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,400 CHF		 PREMIUM	23.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.39 CHF		  GEARING	7.8 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.SEP.99		 PAYDATE	30.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2,165 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
